<tt xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">一成不变的今天、百无聊赖的日子</text><text for="L2">从某一天开始改变的故事</text><text for="L3">从这里开始，我一定会比以往任何时候都更加像</text><text for="L4">真正的我，New me</text><text for="L5">我越来越擅长挂上笑容</text><text for="L6">总是强作笑脸，日复一日磨损着内心</text><text for="L7">所谓真正的自己根本不存在</text><text for="L8">故作轻松地说：“我感觉很好。”</text><text for="L9">撒着谎说：“我懂你的感受。”</text><text for="L10">简直让人受不了</text><text for="L11">嘿，你有恋人吗？</text><text for="L12">“有没有什么邂逅？”就这样开始了</text><text for="L13">糟糕的一天，糟糕的事情，还有我的上司</text><text for="L14">哦，哦……</text><text for="L15">我讨厌这样，别来跟我搭话</text><text for="L16">因令人不快的多管闲事而定下的、令人郁闷的约定</text><text for="L17">这样的一天开始了</text><text for="L18">约在清晨的车站见面</text><text for="L19">比平时更精心地打扮，却没什么特别</text><text for="L20">心神不宁的我</text><text for="L21">听见那道呼唤我名字的声音，抬起了头</text><text for="L22">我遇见了未知</text><text for="L23">我完全不懂你到底在说什么</text><text for="L24">哦，我遇见了未知</text><text for="L25">留着长刘海的</text><text for="L26">我遇见了未知</text><text for="L27">我遇见了他，他神秘莫测</text><text for="L28">故事就从这场意想不到的相遇开始</text><text for="L29">互道“初次见面”之后</text><text for="L30">转眼间，到了此刻</text><text for="L31">破风冲了出去</text><text for="L32">两个人把平淡如常的日子抛在身后</text><text for="L33">穿过了街道</text><text for="L34">是啊，我遇见了未知</text><text for="L35">我完全不懂你到底在说什么</text><text for="L36">哦，我遇见了未知</text><text for="L37">穿着宽松衬衫的</text><text for="L38">我遇见了未知</text><text for="L39">我不知道哪条路才算属于自己</text><text for="L40">即使故事发展得如此不可思议</text><text for="L41">你带来的、充满惊奇的</text><text for="L42">这匆忙纷乱的一天让我察觉</text><text for="L43">我一直以来真正讨厌的，想必就是</text><text for="L44">我自己</text><text for="L45">向全新的日子起飞</text><text for="L46">把一如往常的自己整个打碎，哦，哦</text><text for="L47">无论明天会怎样到来</text><text for="L48">我都决定，要活出我自己</text><text for="L49">是啊，我遇见了未知</text><text for="L50">亲手解锁一扇扇属于我的门</text><text for="L51">哦，我还会遇见新的未知</text><text for="L52">将一成不变的今天、无聊的日子</text><text for="L53">改变它们的，正是今天</text><text for="L54">不要回头</text><text for="L55">从这里开始</text><text for="L56">我的故事</text></translation></translations><translations/><songwriters><songwriter>Ayase</songwriter></songwriters></iTunesMetadata><amll:meta key="musicName" value="New me"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="YOASOBI"/><amll:meta key="album" value="New me - Single"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1778233191"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:26.129"><div begin="7.574" end="26.331" itunes:songPart="Intro"><p begin="7.574" end="11.821" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="7.574" end="8.629">お決まりの</span><span begin="8.629" end="9.071">今日</span><span begin="9.071" end="9.594">が</span> <span begin="9.594" end="10.279">退屈</span><span begin="10.279" end="10.661">な</span><span begin="10.661" end="11.260">日々</span><span begin="11.260" end="11.821">が</span></p><p begin="11.874" end="16.644" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="11.874" end="12.504">変わり</span><span begin="12.504" end="13.135">始</span><span begin="13.135" end="13.429">め</span><span begin="13.429" end="13.972">た</span> <span begin="14.045" end="14.529">ある</span><span begin="14.529" end="15.050">日の</span><span begin="15.050" end="15.554">物</span><span begin="15.554" end="16.644">語</span></p><p begin="16.696" end="23.291" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="16.696" end="17.410">ここから</span><span begin="17.410" end="17.797">きっ</span><span begin="17.797" end="18.354">と</span> <span begin="18.354" end="18.798">これ</span><span begin="18.798" end="19.581">までの</span><span begin="19.581" end="20.245">どんな</span><span begin="20.245" end="21.043">私</span><span begin="21.043" end="21.734">より</span><span begin="21.734" end="22.419">ずっ</span><span begin="22.419" end="23.291">と</span></p><p begin="23.784" end="26.331" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="23.784" end="24.528">私</span><span begin="24.528" end="24.891">に</span><span begin="24.891" end="25.179">な</span><span begin="25.179" end="25.574">る</span> <span begin="25.574" end="25.959">New</span> <span begin="25.959" end="26.331">me</span></p></div><div begin="33.040" end="50.442" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="33.040" end="36.255" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="33.040" end="33.393">どん</span><span begin="33.393" end="33.677">どん</span><span begin="33.677" end="34.075">上手</span><span begin="34.075" end="34.371">に</span><span begin="34.371" end="34.931">なっていく</span><span begin="34.931" end="35.534">smi</span><span begin="35.534" end="36.255">le</span></p><p begin="36.279" end="41.717" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="36.279" end="37.039">いつも</span><span begin="37.039" end="38.369">愛</span><span begin="38.473" end="38.782">想</span><span begin="38.782" end="39.244">良く</span> <span begin="39.244" end="39.580">Day</span> <span begin="39.580" end="39.847">by</span> <span begin="39.847" end="40.163">day</span> <span begin="40.163" end="40.650">擦り</span><span begin="40.650" end="41.082">減ら</span><span begin="41.082" end="41.292">し</span><span begin="41.292" end="41.717">た</span></p><p begin="41.739" end="44.746" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.739" end="42.344">本当</span><span begin="42.344" end="42.509">の</span><span begin="42.509" end="43.037">自分</span><span begin="43.037" end="43.589">なんて</span><span begin="43.589" end="43.779">居</span><span begin="43.779" end="44.126">な</span><span begin="44.126" end="44.746">い</span></p><p begin="44.780" end="46.854" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="44.780" end="45.288">嘯</span><span begin="45.288" end="45.538">いた</span> <span begin="45.538" end="45.733">"</span><span begin="45.733" end="45.833">I'm</span> <span begin="45.833" end="46.398">feeling</span> <span begin="46.398" end="46.687">good.</span><span begin="46.687" end="46.854">"</span></p><p begin="46.863" end="49.021" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="46.863" end="47.204">嘘</span><span begin="47.204" end="47.425">付</span><span begin="47.425" end="47.796">きな</span> <span begin="47.796" end="47.932">"</span><span begin="47.932" end="48.032">I'm</span> <span begin="48.032" end="48.589">feeling</span> <span begin="48.589" end="48.859">you.</span><span begin="48.859" end="49.021">"</span></p><p begin="49.070" end="50.442" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="49.070" end="49.649">たまら</span><span begin="49.649" end="50.094">ない</span><span begin="50.094" end="50.442">わ</span></p></div><div begin="50.498" end="1:05.532" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="50.498" end="52.030" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="50.498" end="50.821">Hey</span> <span begin="50.821" end="51.123">you</span> <span begin="51.123" end="51.426">恋</span><span begin="51.426" end="51.726">人</span><span begin="51.726" end="52.030">は？</span></p><p begin="52.089" end="54.168" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="52.089" end="52.263">出</span><span begin="52.263" end="52.670">会い</span><span begin="52.670" end="52.922">とか</span><span begin="52.922" end="53.215">はどう</span><span begin="53.215" end="53.339">？</span> <span begin="53.339" end="53.713">始</span><span begin="53.713" end="54.168">まった</span></p><p begin="54.232" end="55.986" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="54.232" end="54.509">Bad</span> <span begin="54.509" end="54.865">day,</span> <span begin="54.865" end="55.110">bad</span> <span begin="55.110" end="55.414">things,</span> <span begin="55.414" end="55.714">my</span> <span begin="55.714" end="55.986">boss</span></p><p begin="55.996" end="57.094" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="55.996" end="56.240">Oh,</span> <span begin="56.240" end="56.521">oh</span><span begin="56.521" end="57.094">...</span></p><p begin="56.411" end="59.051" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="56.411" end="56.794">嫌い</span><span begin="56.794" end="57.126">なの</span> <span begin="57.126" end="57.525">話</span><span begin="57.525" end="57.802">し</span><span begin="57.802" end="58.358">かけ</span><span begin="58.358" end="58.679">ない</span><span begin="58.679" end="59.051">で</span></p><p begin="59.158" end="1:02.673" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="59.158" end="59.861">不愉快な</span><span begin="59.861" end="1:00.627">お節介で</span><span begin="1:00.627" end="1:01.383">決まった</span> <span begin="1:01.383" end="1:02.172">憂鬱な</span><span begin="1:02.172" end="1:02.673">約束</span></p><p begin="1:02.761" end="1:05.532" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.761" end="1:03.348">そんな</span><span begin="1:03.348" end="1:03.690">一</span><span begin="1:03.690" end="1:04.176">日</span><span begin="1:04.176" end="1:04.439">が</span><span begin="1:04.439" end="1:04.971">始</span><span begin="1:04.971" end="1:05.532">まる</span></p></div><div begin="1:06.347" end="1:27.069" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:06.347" end="1:10.642" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:06.347" end="1:06.937">待ち</span><span begin="1:06.937" end="1:07.719">合わせ</span><span begin="1:07.719" end="1:08.319">は</span><span begin="1:08.319" end="1:09.037">朝</span><span begin="1:09.037" end="1:09.393">の</span> <span begin="1:09.393" end="1:10.083">sta</span><span begin="1:10.083" end="1:10.642">tion</span></p><p begin="1:10.695" end="1:16.118" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:10.695" end="1:11.470">いつも</span><span begin="1:11.470" end="1:12.078">より</span><span begin="1:12.078" end="1:12.667">も</span><span begin="1:12.667" end="1:12.993">着</span><span begin="1:12.993" end="1:13.636">飾</span><span begin="1:13.636" end="1:14.022">る</span> <span begin="1:14.022" end="1:14.527">But</span> <span begin="1:14.527" end="1:15.037">not</span> <span begin="1:15.037" end="1:15.585">spe</span><span begin="1:15.585" end="1:16.118">cial</span></p><p begin="1:16.128" end="1:19.895" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:16.128" end="1:16.447">浮</span><span begin="1:16.447" end="1:17.052">き</span><span begin="1:17.052" end="1:17.535">足</span><span begin="1:17.535" end="1:18.083">立つ</span><span begin="1:18.083" end="1:18.880">私</span><span begin="1:18.880" end="1:19.895">の</span></p><p begin="1:20.005" end="1:27.069" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:20.005" end="1:20.301">名</span><span begin="1:20.301" end="1:21.028">前</span><span begin="1:21.028" end="1:21.397">を</span><span begin="1:21.397" end="1:22.084">呼ぶ</span><span begin="1:22.084" end="1:23.179">その</span><span begin="1:23.179" end="1:23.853">声</span><span begin="1:23.853" end="1:24.282">に</span> <span begin="1:24.282" end="1:24.952">顔</span><span begin="1:24.952" end="1:25.656">上げ</span><span begin="1:25.656" end="1:27.069">た</span></p></div><div begin="1:25.184" end="1:44.868" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:25.184" end="1:27.069" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:25.184" end="1:25.751">I've</span> <span begin="1:25.751" end="1:26.254">met</span> <span begin="1:26.254" end="1:26.575">the</span> <span begin="1:26.575" end="1:27.069">unknown</span></p><p begin="1:27.079" end="1:29.245" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:27.079" end="1:27.282">I</span> <span begin="1:27.282" end="1:27.576">don't</span> <span begin="1:27.576" end="1:27.903">know</span> <span begin="1:27.903" end="1:28.146">what</span> <span begin="1:28.146" end="1:28.423">you</span> <span begin="1:28.423" end="1:28.701">mean</span> <span begin="1:28.701" end="1:28.970">at</span> <span begin="1:28.970" end="1:29.245">all</span></p><p begin="1:29.297" end="1:31.393" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:29.297" end="1:29.553">Oh,</span> <span begin="1:29.553" end="1:30.093">I've</span> <span begin="1:30.093" end="1:30.622">met</span> <span begin="1:30.622" end="1:30.969">the</span> <span begin="1:30.969" end="1:31.393">unknown</span></p><p begin="1:31.400" end="1:33.816" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:31.400" end="1:31.910">